  "instruction": "`C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\Desktop\\\\TUTOR2.DSN` is a schematic. Traverse all primitive part instances in it and export `C:\\\\Users\\\\User\\\\Desktop\\\\pin_map.json`.\n\nThe top-level JSON fields must be `total_parts`, `total_pins`, and `parts`. The `parts` array must be sorted ascending by `ref`, and each element must have the form `{ref, pin_count, pin_numbers}`.\n\nRequirements:\n- Multipart instances that share the same refdes must be merged into one entry.\n- `pin_numbers` must be merged, deduplicated, and sorted lexicographically.\n- `total_parts` must equal the length of the `parts` array.\n- `total_pins` must equal the sum of all `pin_count` values.",
